---
/**
 * Fresh Phantom — Privacy Policy
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Fresh Phantom">
  <Nav />
  <main class="prose-page site-section">
    <div class="prose-page__header">
      <div class="fp-label prose-page__label">Legal</div>
      <div class="fp-divider"></div>
      <h1 class="fp-display prose-page__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="fp-label prose-page__date">Effective: September 9, 2026</div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose-page__body">
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>Fresh Phantom (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; &ldquo;our&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through freshphantom.com, how we use it, and your choices.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you provide</h3>
      <p>When you submit the inquiry form, we collect the information you enter: name, email address, phone number (optional), company or project name (optional), service interest, message, budget, and timing.</p>

      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>We use Cloudflare&rsquo;s infrastructure, which may collect standard server logs including IP address, browser type, referring URL, and pages visited. We do not use third-party analytics trackers or advertising cookies.</p>

      <h3>Cloudflare Turnstile</h3>
      <p>Our inquiry form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to prevent automated submissions. Turnstile may collect interaction data to distinguish human visitors from bots. This data is processed by Cloudflare under their <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you submit to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Evaluate and respond to your inquiry.</li>
        <li>Send you a confirmation copy of your submission.</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about a potential engagement.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Processors</h2>
      <p>We use the following services to operate this site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> &mdash; hosting and content delivery.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> &mdash; bot protection.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> &mdash; transactional email delivery for inquiry submissions and confirmations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Each processor handles data according to their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Inquiry submissions are retained for as long as necessary to evaluate and respond to your request, and for reasonable record-keeping thereafter. We do not maintain indefinite archives of inquiry data.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time through our <a href="/#inquiry">inquiry form</a>. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not set first-party cookies for tracking or analytics. Cloudflare may set functional cookies necessary for security and performance. We do not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies.</p>

      <h2>8. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed at individuals under the age of 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted to this page. The effective date at the top reflects the most recent revision.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions or requests may be directed through our <a href="/#inquiry">inquiry form</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
